Assertions (CONFIG expression → evaluated instant; every receipt prints raw phase + eased result separately, full predicates over ALL pins/cubes):
- P0 stem start: `stateAt(CONFIG, CONFIG.tStemOffMs)` → 500 ms: stemP 0, stemOpacity 1, pressP 0, cubeVisible 0.
